wifi: add RDA599x combo chip power controller (rdacombodev)

Forward-port of the vendor rdacombodev power/identification driver for
the RDA599x WiFi+BT combo chip (Orange Pi i96). The per-chip power
sequence tables (rda_5990/5991/e/f/g) are verbatim vendor code; the main
controller is rewritten for DT-based I2C client instantiation. The
vendor's modem-PMU-backed 26M/32k/LDO management is stubbed (modem
firmware keeps the shared clocks up); verified by the chip version read
at probe. WiFi is powered on at probe as a bring-up aid until the
rdawlan driver takes control.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [local forward-port of vendor driver]

Signed-off-by: Sergio Marin <sergio.marin@pantacor.com>
---

